I'd say the easiest classes are probably Valkyrie, Barbarian, and Samurai.
And I'd say that Valkyrie is probably easier than the other two.  They
have the advantages of being neutral and getting the best weapon in the
game.  I haven't had much luck playing Priests.

The 3.1 dungeon is more complicated than the older dungeons--there are
now a few side trips.  The main dungeon is over 50 levels deep, but if
you go everywhere you will get to around 75 levels.

